  "instructions": [
    "Heat the comal over medium heat and roast the onion and garlic until fragrant.",
    "Add the red curry paste and stir for 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add the chicken and cook until browned, about 5-6 minutes.",
    "Add the spices (turmeric, coriander, cumin, garam masala) and stir for 1 minute.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and cook, covered, for 15-20 minutes or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "Stir in the passion fruit pulp and adjust seasonings to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh cilantro, if desired.",
    "Pressure cook for 10-12 minutes if in a hurry."
